        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "You can download your e-Aadhaar PDF directly through the MyAadhaar Portal using your Aadhaar number, Enrolment ID, or Virtual ID.",
        "snippet_highlighted_words": [
          "through the MyAadhaar Portal using your Aadhaar number, Enrolment ID, or Virtual ID"
        ],
        "reference_indexes": [
          0,
          1
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Steps to Download e-Aadhaar PDF"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Go to the official MyAadhaar Portal."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Choose to log in or select Download Aadhaar."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Enter your 12-digit Aadhaar Number, 28-digit Enrolment ID (EID), or 16-digit Virtual ID (VID)."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Input the Captcha verification code shown on the screen."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Click Send OTP to receive a One-Time Password on your registered mobile number."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Enter the OTP and click Verify and Download to save the PDF file."
          }
        ],
        "reference_indexes": [
          0,
          1,
          2
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Opening the PDF File"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "The downloaded e-Aadhaar is a password-protected PDF file.",
            "reference_indexes": [
              0,
              3
            ]
          },
          {
            "snippet": "The password combines the first 4 letters of your name in uppercase (CAPITAL) and your year of birth (YYYY).",
            "list": [
              {
                "snippet": "Example: If your name is SURESH KUMAR and birth year is 1990, the password is SURE1990."
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "reference_indexes": [
          0
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "If you're having trouble receiving your OTP, let me know if your mobile number is linked to your Aadhaar so we can look at alternative options."
      }
    ],
